{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"34":{"eng-name":"Clothing (Kitab Al-Libas)","ara-name":"كتاب اللباس"}},"section_detail":{"34":{"hadithnumber_first":4020,"hadithnumber_last":4158,"arabicnumber_first":4020,"arabicnumber_last":4158}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4032,"arabicnumber":4032,"text":"Aishah رضي الله عنها a dit : Le Messager d’Allah ﷺ est sorti un matin en portant un vêtement multicolore en poil de chèvre noir. Rapporté par Utbah ibn AbdusSulami رضي الله عنه : J’ai demandé au Messager d’Allah ﷺ de m’habiller. Il m’a donné deux vêtements grossiers en lin","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Hasan Isnaad"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":34,"hadith":13},"chapter":{"id":6,"ara-name":"باب فِي لُبْسِ الصُّوفِ وَالشَّعْرِ","eng-name":"Regarding Wearing Wool And Hair","isFirstHadith":true}}]}